* tracking.dts
* AI-Portal tracking workspace environment (AIF-086), same shape as metadata.dts.
* Tracking DBFs live under DATA\METADATA\PORTAL. CDX/LMDB are co-located there for a
* self-contained workspace (move to INDEXES\METADATA\PORTAL / LMDB\METADATA\PORTAL to
* match the metadata-lane convention if you prefer separate index trees).
* Paths resolve relative to the runtime DATA root.
SETPATH DBF metadata\portal
SETPATH INDEXES metadata\portal
SETPATH LMDB metadata\portal
